<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-MILLION DOLLAR CHALLENGE FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-MILLION DOLLAR CHALLENGE FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SUN CITY, South Africa 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Million Dollar Challenge first round scores on Friday:</p>
<p>65 Colin Montgomerie (Britain)</p>
<p>67 Steve Jones (U.S.), Ernie Els (South Africa)</p>
<p>68 Steve Stricker (U.S.), Ian Woosnam (Britain), Corey Pavin (U.S.), Mark Brooks (U.S.)</p>
<p>69 Mark O'Meara (U.S.), Bernhard Langer (Germany)</p>
<p>71 Nick Price (Zimbabwe), Tom Lehman (U.S.)</p>
<p>73 Nick Faldo (Britain)</p>
